# ============================================================

# Cache
*_cache/
/cache/
.quarto/
.quarto_cache/

# Temporary files
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md

# Rendered output
*.html
*.pdf
*_files/
**/*_files/

# pkgdown site
docs/


